WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.680
What should I do?

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.890
<i>Excuse me, you're one of Raimon's players, right?</i>

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:28.530
<i>Y-Yes?</i>

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:34.930
<i>I was one of Amagi-kun's classmates in elementary school, Kousaka Yukie.</i>

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.490
<i>Amagi-senpai's...</i>

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.900
I should tell him.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.140
Amagi.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.920
You're in the starting lineup today, okay?

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:49.620
Yes, sir!

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.620
I'm counting on you.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:55.080
All right!

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.470
Um, Amagi-senpai...

00:00:57.470 --> 00:01:00.240
Kageyama, I'm in the starting lineup!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.660
I'll get to tell Mahoro my feelings!

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.080
Y-Yes...

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:11.020
We're here at Pinball Stadium where it's packed with anticipation and excitement!

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:16.550
The quarter-final with Raimon Jr. High versus Gen'ei Academy is about to start!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:30.290
Each team has won their way up here,

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:34.610
and the team to win this match will be one of the best four this year!

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:41.020
Coach Kidou has put Amagi, who hadn't played in the previous game, out in the starting lineup!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:45.740
Mahoro, I'll show you how our soccer works.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.240
It's useless to defy Fifth Sector.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:52.250
You can't rebel against it.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:04:00.270
<i>I think this is a good chance to tell Amagi-kun.</i>

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.040
<i>It's not necessary.</i>

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:06.690
<i>Not for that coward who can't accept reality.</i>

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:14.320
<i>Then why do you look so much in pain...?</i>

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.620
Why do you try to take on everything by yourself?

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:24.680
Gen'ei Academy makes the kickoff!

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.330
You won't get through!

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.530
Shindou steals the ball!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.820
You won't have your way!

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:32.520
Tenma!

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.030
Okay!

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:36.040
Over here!

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:37.210
Here!

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:46.540
Tenma!

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.070
What's that?

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:55.550
There it is!

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:59.740
This is Pinball Stadium's special function, jet bumpers!

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:01.570
The pass fired back on us.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.950
Is Tenma okay?

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:10.870
Gen'ei Academy is on the offense with a throw-in!

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.350
Shindou steals the ball!

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:16.960
Raimon gets another chance!

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.990
If I kick the ball above the bumper, it shouldn't fire back.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:22.690
Kurama!

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:23.460
Got it!

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:29.930
It's in the air too long!

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:32.310
You won't get away!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.980
Raimon is having a hard fight in Pinball Stadium!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.210
Nishiki finally has the ball!

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:46.070
He heads deep into Gen'ei Academy's camp!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:52.300
Acrobat Keep!

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.470
Nishiki makes a middle shoot!

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:02.170
What?!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.440
There it is! This time it's the flippers!

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:06.460
Tenma!

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.090
Okay!

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.140
They've got the ball that's bounced back!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.020
Gen'ei Academy counterattacks!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.000
I'll stop you, Mahoro!

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:21.270
Amagi-senpai...

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.490
You're in the way.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:27.860
Not while I'm here!

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.780
Kurumada clears the ball!

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.810
Nice job, Kurumada!

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.160
At least he's slightly capable.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.230
Nice defense!

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:39.210
That was nothing.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.580
But this is difficult...

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.860
We don't know where the ball will go.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:44.630
Yeah.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.110
So this is what it meant by pinball?

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.670
We can't set up plays with those in the way.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:51.650
This is bad.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:56.350
What?

00:06:57.590 --> 00:06:58.380
Gen'ichi!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.490
Shiranui uses the accelerator belts to speed up the ball!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.680
That was a close one!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:16.200
Using the pole, Gen'ei Academy brings the ball up for a shoot instantaneously!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.120
That attack just now...

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:22.100
They know which way the ball will bounce back.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.240
Haruna.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.320
Yes?

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.900
Make a record of when the bumpers and poles activate.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:31.880
A record?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.810
This can record videos too.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.160
Gen'ei Academy makes a fierce attack!

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:43.270
They're accurately trapping the ball as it bounces off the bumpers in unpredictable directions!

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.560
They aren't giving Raimon a chance!

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:57.700
Gen'ei Academy's coach must have developed a strategy to use this stadium's features to their advantage.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:03.910
This is just the start of your experience with the terror that is Gen'ei Academy.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:09.850
Dimension Cut!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:10.970
Wai-

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.430
You can't just do that!

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.130
Mahoro!

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:15.090
Yeah!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.260
Mahoro heads up through the center towards Raimon's goal!

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.030
I won't let you make it in!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.680
It's useless.

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:25.240
No one can stop my hissatsu shoot.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:28.670
Phantom Shot!

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:35.200
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:40.200
What?!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:41.870
I won't let it go in!

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:46.490
Fence Of Gaia!

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:50.020
No way!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.050
Goal!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.180
Gen'ei Academy takes the first point!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:03.020
That's the hissatsu shoot that always lands in the goal?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.630
The ball went right through our guard...

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:07.540
Just what kind of shoot is it?

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:09.860
See that, Amagi?

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:14.440
This is the impossible-to-defend Phantom Shot.

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:17.820
Impossible to defend?

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.550
A shoot like that doesn't exist!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:22.590
There has to be a way to block it!

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:26.350
You still talk big, despite being a coward.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:28.210
A coward?

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.350
I'll make you learn...

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:34.550
That you've got no choice but to obey those you can't possibly stand up to.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.340
Taiyou-kun, time to take your temperature.

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:42.560
Okay~

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.700
Examinations are so troublesome.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.930
You keep having to take my temperature.

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:50.940
It's what's necessary, just put up with it.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.330
I am.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.070
That's why I'm not watching.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.540
I end up wanting to play soccer whenever I watch Raimon's matches.

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:00.070
I see.

00:10:01.010 --> 00:10:02.150
And besides...

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.100
Tenma will definitely win.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:06.700
So I don't have to watch.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:15.200
You kind of resemble him.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.140
What?

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:18.980
Nothing.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.080
There's not much time left in the first half!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.560
Who will get the next point?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.260
Again?

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.080
The ball was bounced back again!

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:39.860
Did Shindou predict it? He's stolen the ball!

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.880
If we dodge the bumpers with short passes...

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:43.630
Captain!

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:46.050
You noticed too?

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:46.690
Yes!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.770
Soyokaze Step!

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:58.300
Tenma!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.340
Kurama-senpai!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:07.350
Sidewinder!

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:15.960
Shadow Grab!

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:22.160
No good.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.410
That was close!

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.250
You almost had it!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.660
We'll get it next time!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:27.640
Yeah!

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:32.940
You won't get through!

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:35.420
He...

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:36.590
Tenma!

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:37.490
Okay!

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:41.050
Tenma, sorry.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.590
I'll get it next time.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:43.090
Okay!

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.850
The likes of you...

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:47.990
Mahoro!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:49.600
Mahoro!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.420
I've got it!

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.250
Mahoro, focus!

00:11:58.470 --> 00:11:59.090
Yes, sir.

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.410
It's our faceoff against Raimon at last.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:10.400
Raimon has been gaining victories against Fifth Sector's orders.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:13.320
You understand that this is unforgivable behavior, right?

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:14.320
Yes, sir.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.040
We'll end Raimon's revolt here.

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:19.610
That is the duty we've been assigned.

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:20.390
Yes, sir!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.610
You can't revolt.

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:30.890
He really is suffering.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.690
Trick Ball!

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:38.400
Wait!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.750
What a terrifying illusion!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:46.030
As expected from the team of mysterious magic!

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:47.930
Mahoro!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.450
Got it!

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:51.940
The Fifth's soccer is just.

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:53.470
I'll get you to understand that.

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:55.290
I'll stop you this time!

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:58.340
I told you, it's absolutely impossible.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:00.910
Nothing's impossible in soccer!

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.550
Then I'll prove it to you!

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:07.780
Phantom Shot!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.940
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.710
It's in!

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:25.740
Phantom Shot makes it into Raimon's goal again!

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:31.700
Do you understand now? Someone like you couldn't possibly stop my shoot.

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.120
A revolution is impossible for you.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.880
There's the whistle!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:43.370
Gen'ei Academy ends the first half with a two-point lead!

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:49.300
Here, Tenma.

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:51.560
Thanks.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.960
This field looks really hard to play in.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:56.850
Yeah, but we have to find a way through it.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:11.660
Mahoro...

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:15.120
<i>Someone like you couldn't possibly stop my shoot.</i>

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.780
<i>A revolution is impossible for you.</i>

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.650
It's not impossible...

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:23.650
I'll show you.

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.970
Kousaka-san!

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:51.100
About what you told me before the match...

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:56.620
I couldn't tell Amagi-senpai.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.050
I see...

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:05.550
I think <i>you</i>  should be the one to tell him.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:11.220
That's what you originally meant to do when you came to our end, right?

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:15.240
If you talk it out, you'll clear up your misunderstandings.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.880
Amagi-senpai.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.010
It's been a long time.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:51.530
Yeah, a long time.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:54.580
What did you want to talk about?

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:00.570
Um... Raimon is fighting against our school, right?

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:04.090
And Mahoro-kun and you are playing, so...

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:09.840
I thought it was time to tell you... about what happened back then.

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:12.180
Back then?

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:15.360
When Mahoro-kun stood up to the bullies.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.870
When he told them not to bully you.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:23.080
What's there to tell me? I'm the one who knows that the best.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:26.850
Mahoro refused to talk to me after that.

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:30.490
He broke off our friendship!

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:32.260
No, that's not it.

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:35.910
Mahoro-kun didn't do that because he hates you.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:42.480
Back then, the bullies started targeting him instead of you because he covered for you.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:49.690
He stopped talking to you so that you wouldn't get caught up in it.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:53.560
He thought that you'd get bullied again if you were with him.

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:55.990
No way...

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.280
Don't bully Amagi!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:12.710
He did it to help me?

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:16.180
Why are you telling me now?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:20.400
I want us to go back to those times.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:23.870
What do you want me to do about it?

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.260
I want you to save Mahoro-kun.

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:30.180
He's in a lot of pain.

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:31.330
Pain?

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:32.790
Yeah.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:37.130
He probably knows that what he's doing right now is wrong.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:43.860
But he told me himself that he thinks soccer should be managed.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.010
I don't think he was being true to himself.

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:50.660
Amagi-kun, you're the only one who can find out for sure!

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:58.590
Sorry, the second half's starting.

00:17:58.590 --> 00:17:59.710
I need to head back.

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:08.170
What should I do?

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.650
Amagi-senpai!

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:13.180
What happened?

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:15.170
Did you talk it out?

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:18.700
Yeah, but now I don't know.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:24.030
Mahoro might have a grudge against me.

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:30.590
There's a moment of time lag before the bumpers and poles respond.

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:31.730
Time lag?

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:32.310
Yes.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:38.340
There's a small amount of time between when the sensors detect the ball or players and when the traps activate.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.500
We'll use that small gap.

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:42.280
What do you mean?

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:46.970
Mahoro.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.650
You made a mistake in the first half.

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:51.440
I'm sorry.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:55.780
You haven't lowered your guard after getting the first point, have you?

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:57.160
No.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:03.940
Unless you defeat Raimon, you'll have no future in soccer, is that understood?

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:04.740
Yes, sir.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:05.720
Very well.

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:09.420
That's right.

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.270
A revolution is impossible.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.600
The strong are meant to be obeyed.

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:16.960
I want us all to smile together.

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.480
Like the old days...

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.880
The second half is about to kick off!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.810
Got it, everyone?

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:31.480
Be ready to play anytime you're called in.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:32.060
Yes, sir!

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:37.630
Tenma!

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:38.730
Got it!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:40.720
You won't get through.

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:41.610
Tsurugi!

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:49.540
You won't be able to attack quickly in front of the bumpers.

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:50.850
Now!

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:51.790
Here it comes!

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:58.780
Death Drop!

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.510
What?!

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.630
Goal!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:07.180
Tsurugi makes it in!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:10.100
Raimon scores one back!

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.710
You did it, Tsurugi!

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:19.770
If you make a super quick shoot at close-range, the ball will pass through before the bumpers react.

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:25.370
The opponent will depend on the bumpers to do the work for them and let their guard down.

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:28.350
We lost a point...

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:39.630
Hamano!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.190
Yeah!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.650
Mahoro clears it!

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.470
But this was a nearly dangerous play!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:02.110
We have to win.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.640
To continue Fifth Sector's soccer.

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:10.830
Mahoro, is that really your soccer?

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:45.890
Will Amagi-senpai's feelings reach his target?

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:49.190
And the one to stand in front of the goal in Sangoku-senpai's place is...!

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:53.930
